(2772271, 387805, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Plus 1 for me recognizing it without being bashed over the head by the picture''s title, minus 1 for bashing me over the head with the movie title in the picture itself, minus 1 for bashing me over the head by telling me in the title that the girl''s in the mirror.  It LOOKS like a photo of two pictures, and the title doesn''t correct that.<br/> <br/>That said, for this movie, a picture of two polaroids is dead on target.<br/> <br/>Mush all that around and it lands on a 5.</td>', 'Great concept.  Plus 1 for me recognizing it without being bashed over the head by the picture''s title, minus 1 for bashing me over the head with the movie title in the picture itself, minus 1 for bashing me over the head by telling me in the title that the girl''s in the mirror.  It LOOKS like a photo of two pictures, and the title doesn''t correct that. That said, for this movie, a picture of two polaroids is dead on target. Mush all that around and it lands on a 5.', '2006-08-30 01:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
