(2772568, 387019, 39429, '<td valign="top">This really gives the feel of the movie.  (Just watched the show last night.)  The yellow cast is too strong for the actual movie, but that wouldn''t be known if it had not been viewed recently.  Also, it this is a "creature", the head would be bigger, if a villager, the cloak would be yellow.  Despite these details, you''ve done a great job of capturing the feel and creating the mystery of the movie.  7</td>', 'This really gives the feel of the movie.  (Just watched the show last night.)  The yellow cast is too strong for the actual movie, but that wouldn''t be known if it had not been viewed recently.  Also, it this is a "creature", the head would be bigger, if a villager, the cloak would be yellow.  Despite these details, you''ve done a great job of capturing the feel and creating the mystery of the movie.  7', '2006-08-30 02:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
