(2773041, 387193, 16004, '<td valign="top">never actually saw the film (too scared!) but i thought the coat was more red than pink, and a bit longer.  anyway, that minr quibble aside, i think this is a very lovely image, with rich beautiful colours, great composition and a fair bit of foreboding ominence to it which is fitting given the film it''s emulating.   to me though, it doesn''t feel all that cinematic, rather a piece of photographic art...  8.</td>', 'never actually saw the film (too scared!) but i thought the coat was more red than pink, and a bit longer.  anyway, that minr quibble aside, i think this is a very lovely image, with rich beautiful colours, great composition and a fair bit of foreboding ominence to it which is fitting given the film it''s emulating.   to me though, it doesn''t feel all that cinematic, rather a piece of photographic art...  8.', '2006-08-30 04:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
