(2776050, 387632, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is great.  When I woke up this morning my husband (Timfythetoo) said I had to look at this pic.  At first we wondered "how did he/she find all those players with old Sox uniforms?"  Then I remembered hearing about a movie reunion and we checked the web and discovered the activities that go on at the real "Field of Dreams".  Awesome!  Way to capture an opportunity!  Beautifully done and I even like the border.************** Hopefully I''m not making an incorrect assumption regarding your set up.  Either way - I''m back to bump. 9  Well done.</td>', 'This is great.  When I woke up this morning my husband (Timfythetoo) said I had to look at this pic.  At first we wondered "how did he/she find all those players with old Sox uniforms?"  Then I remembered hearing about a movie reunion and we checked the web and discovered the activities that go on at the real "Field of Dreams".  Awesome!  Way to capture an opportunity!  Beautifully done and I even like the border.************** Hopefully I''m not making an incorrect assumption regarding your set up.  Either way - I''m back to bump. 9  Well done.', '2006-08-30 20:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
