(2776566, 387460, 56658, '<td valign="top">I tried to look up the movie but couldn''t find anything. Giving you the benifit of the doubt, I find the cutains blurry and distracting. seems like a decent setup though.</td>', 'I tried to look up the movie but couldn''t find anything. Giving you the benifit of the doubt, I find the cutains blurry and distracting. seems like a decent setup though.', '2006-08-30 22:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776577, 387880, 19944, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea, but didn''t do it.  As far as yours goes, my first thought was that your white balance could have used some tweaking, but the more I look at it, I think the way you have it gives the photo a better feel.</td>', 'I had the same idea, but didn''t do it.  As far as yours goes, my first thought was that your white balance could have used some tweaking, but the more I look at it, I think the way you have it gives the photo a better feel.', '2006-08-30 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776583, 385728, 19944, '<td valign="top">It''s always a risk using Woody.  I like woody photos.  I submitted one myself.  But, if they are done well, they should score well.  This one, to me, is done well.  I like the black &amp; white.</td>', 'It''s always a risk using Woody.  I like woody photos.  I submitted one myself.  But, if they are done well, they should score well.  This one, to me, is done well.  I like the black & white.', '2006-08-30 22:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776590, 387955, 35530, '<td valign="top">Since I am not familiar with this movie, I had to check on-line. You have managed to capture a remarkable similarity with the movie poster. Nice work.</td>', 'Since I am not familiar with this movie, I had to check on-line. You have managed to capture a remarkable similarity with the movie poster. Nice work.', '2006-08-30 22:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776596, 386529, 19944, '<td valign="top">To me, the contrast on this seems to be too bright.  And the fact the the bridge starts righ in the middle of the left side just seems  a little off.  Perhaps if it were taken from another angle so that your eye is led to the covered bridge from the lower left corner of the photo....</td>', 'To me, the contrast on this seems to be too bright.  And the fact the the bridge starts righ in the middle of the left side just seems  a little off.  Perhaps if it were taken from another angle so that your eye is led to the covered bridge from the lower left corner of the photo....', '2006-08-30 22:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776604, 387222, 19944, '<td valign="top">To me, this seems like you were shooting into the sun.  It''s just too bright for my taste.</td>', 'To me, this seems like you were shooting into the sun.  It''s just too bright for my taste.', '2006-08-30 22:15:37.000000', NULL, 1);
