(2776636, 385138, 19944, '<td valign="top">The photo is just too small.  And I looked at imdb.com, and I can''t find a movie called ''Fire Sky''.  I found "Fire in the Sky" about an alien abduction.<br/> <br/>Cool clouds and colors though.</td>', 'The photo is just too small.  And I looked at imdb.com, and I can''t find a movie called ''Fire Sky''.  I found "Fire in the Sky" about an alien abduction. Cool clouds and colors though.', '2006-08-30 22:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776643, 386254, 19944, '<td valign="top">I''m not wold about the crop.  I think if you''re going to center the clock, perhaps a square crop would work better.  It could be a little sharper, too.</td>', 'I''m not wold about the crop.  I think if you''re going to center the clock, perhaps a square crop would work better.  It could be a little sharper, too.', '2006-08-30 22:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776649, 386308, 19944, '<td valign="top">A Wonderful World of Disney made for TV movie?  How obscure!  Great choice.<br/> <br/>A nice photo with nice lighting.  The focus might be little soft along the left side and that painted background is a little distracting.</td>', 'A Wonderful World of Disney made for TV movie?  How obscure!  Great choice. A nice photo with nice lighting.  The focus might be little soft along the left side and that painted background is a little distracting.', '2006-08-30 22:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
