(2777237, 385156, 811, '<td valign="top">Good action shot.  The whites seem a bit overexposed.  (I am so wanting to make a comment about needing to pull his pants up, but I am going to refrain this time).<br/> <br/>I like the tight crop.  Makes the action seem a bit more intense.</td>', 'Good action shot.  The whites seem a bit overexposed.  (I am so wanting to make a comment about needing to pull his pants up, but I am going to refrain this time). I like the tight crop.  Makes the action seem a bit more intense.', '2006-08-31 01:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2777245, 385957, 811, '<td valign="top">Good action capture.  It looks a bit oversharpened to me as there seems to be an odd grainy look in the sand of the track and the grass.  Compositionally, maybe a tighter crop so that the horses weren''t in the center of the frame would make it a bit stronger.  That might make it feel like there was more room on the right for them to "run into."</td>', 'Good action capture.  It looks a bit oversharpened to me as there seems to be an odd grainy look in the sand of the track and the grass.  Compositionally, maybe a tighter crop so that the horses weren''t in the center of the frame would make it a bit stronger.  That might make it feel like there was more room on the right for them to "run into."', '2006-08-31 01:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
