(2778691, 387378, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is perfect for the challenge!  The positioning of elements in this image is well done and it''s well focused.  Only minor complaint is the center part of your image could use a little more light - note I said "minor complaint".  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is perfect for the challenge!  The positioning of elements in this image is well done and it''s well focused.  Only minor complaint is the center part of your image could use a little more light - note I said "minor complaint".  ;^)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-31 13:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778694, 387439, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I don''t know if this incorporates the actual movie or not...but it''s a very cool shot!  Well composed, great lighting and contrast, fun to look at.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  I don''t know if this incorporates the actual movie or not...but it''s a very cool shot!  Well composed, great lighting and contrast, fun to look at.  Nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-08-31 13:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778699, 384218, 30049, '<td valign="top">Perfect image for this challenge.  Instant recognition of what movie it''s appropriate for.  Very sharp (maybe over sharpened for some monitors) with good positioning of the subject.  May have been able to boost the orange/red a little?  All JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect image for this challenge.  Instant recognition of what movie it''s appropriate for.  Very sharp (maybe over sharpened for some monitors) with good positioning of the subject.  May have been able to boost the orange/red a little?  All JMO of course.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-31 13:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778714, 387464, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t that a pornography film?!  Was Debbie a cheerleader?  Is Dallas now in Australia?  As a male voter I can appreciate the image in front of me, however, I think this is rather shoehorned into the challenge as a "sex sells" kind of shot.</td>', 'Wasn''t that a pornography film?!  Was Debbie a cheerleader?  Is Dallas now in Australia?  As a male voter I can appreciate the image in front of me, however, I think this is rather shoehorned into the challenge as a "sex sells" kind of shot.', '2006-08-31 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778721, 387795, 30049, '<td valign="top">If he was soaking wet I could buy it.  I like the reflections in the water - that''s kinda cool.  The shoreline appears slanted, whether it is or not.  Nice, creative idea - but really - he should be wet!  ;^)  Good luck.</td>', 'If he was soaking wet I could buy it.  I like the reflections in the water - that''s kinda cool.  The shoreline appears slanted, whether it is or not.  Nice, creative idea - but really - he should be wet!  ;^)  Good luck.', '2006-08-31 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778727, 387418, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t that an Indiana Jones movie?  If there''s another "<i>Romancing The Stone</i>" out there my apologies, but I think it''s the first one that will come to mind for the majority of voters.  Creative use of blur is nice here.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Wasn''t that an Indiana Jones movie?  If there''s another "Romancing The Stone" out there my apologies, but I think it''s the first one that will come to mind for the majority of voters.  Creative use of blur is nice here.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-31 13:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
