(2778939, 387799, 57384, '<td valign="top">First off, I like this picture. I like the look of the walls and pipes and it is sharp. On the down side, one minor detail I don''t like is how the heads overlap. As an owner of a copy of Resevoir Dogs I would have loved to see the radio in this picture just to convey the music part of the scene.</td>', 'First off, I like this picture. I like the look of the walls and pipes and it is sharp. On the down side, one minor detail I don''t like is how the heads overlap. As an owner of a copy of Resevoir Dogs I would have loved to see the radio in this picture just to convey the music part of the scene.', '2006-08-31 15:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778950, 387019, 57384, '<td valign="top">I think people will mark this down because it isn''t clear, but I think that''s what you were trying to do and it actually helps this picture more than being crisp would. Honestly this almost looks like a duplicate of the movie poster (although I don''t think this ever was actually in the movie, it doesn''t matter). Good job on the hazy yellow light.</td>', 'I think people will mark this down because it isn''t clear, but I think that''s what you were trying to do and it actually helps this picture more than being crisp would. Honestly this almost looks like a duplicate of the movie poster (although I don''t think this ever was actually in the movie, it doesn''t matter). Good job on the hazy yellow light.', '2006-08-31 15:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
