(2780491, 387378, 39429, '<td valign="top">I can clearly see this scene from the movie and your creation very close to the original.  One of the difficulties is that because the scene is so well known, the differences stand out.  The cloth on the hand, the amount of blood on the painting, the body hair on the model all pull away that feeling.  Even so, this is an outstanding image in its own right and certainly deserves a ribbon. 8</td>', 'I can clearly see this scene from the movie and your creation very close to the original.  One of the difficulties is that because the scene is so well known, the differences stand out.  The cloth on the hand, the amount of blood on the painting, the body hair on the model all pull away that feeling.  Even so, this is an outstanding image in its own right and certainly deserves a ribbon. 8', '2006-08-31 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
