(2780798, 385138, 60281, '<td valign="top">It looks as though it could be quite dramatic but it is way to small to tell.</td>', 'It looks as though it could be quite dramatic but it is way to small to tell.', '2006-09-01 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780826, 385067, 60281, '<td valign="top">The flash has made the picture very harsh. Try bouncing the flash off a white card. If the flash is built into the camera and cant be aimed away to bounce it then try holding some thin white fabric, paper or tissue slightly in front of the flash to diffuse the light a little.</td>', 'The flash has made the picture very harsh. Try bouncing the flash off a white card. If the flash is built into the camera and cant be aimed away to bounce it then try holding some thin white fabric, paper or tissue slightly in front of the flash to diffuse the light a little.', '2006-09-01 01:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780851, 385425, 60281, '<td valign="top">While the darkness of the image adds to the atmosphere I think it is a little too dark and flat. I think a little increase in saturation would help a lot.</td>', 'While the darkness of the image adds to the atmosphere I think it is a little too dark and flat. I think a little increase in saturation would help a lot.', '2006-09-01 01:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780906, 387976, 60281, '<td valign="top">I dont know the film so I cant comment on that aspect. The sky looks good and I like the reflections in the window. Perhaps if you had shot it from lower down and pointing up more it would have been more dramatic. You could have got more sky in it that way and the sky seems to be an important part of this picture.</td>', 'I dont know the film so I cant comment on that aspect. The sky looks good and I like the reflections in the window. Perhaps if you had shot it from lower down and pointing up more it would have been more dramatic. You could have got more sky in it that way and the sky seems to be an important part of this picture.', '2006-09-01 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780934, 388013, 59564, '<td valign="top">Great expression.  I think a different lighting choice may have been cool too.  Maybe more even light on their face.</td>', 'Great expression.  I think a different lighting choice may have been cool too.  Maybe more even light on their face.', '2006-09-01 01:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780940, 385189, 60281, '<td valign="top">Im afraid I dont know the film you are referring to, so I dont know how well this image represents it. I dont think all the blank sky above the pole helps and I would be tempted to crop it off.</td>', 'Im afraid I dont know the film you are referring to, so I dont know how well this image represents it. I dont think all the blank sky above the pole helps and I would be tempted to crop it off.', '2006-09-01 01:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780981, 387813, 59564, '<td valign="top">Hopefully that cleans easy!:)  Just my personal opinion but if the drain was more in focus and the lighting taken down a notch or two it may have added a bit more mood to the picture.  As it is, the lighting is very even and well done but not very interesting.  I comment on the lighting because it is something I am constantly struggling/working on so I tend to notice it more in other pictures.  If you want to see evidence of my battle with lighting take a look at my peas entry :).</td>', 'Hopefully that cleans easy!:)  Just my personal opinion but if the drain was more in focus and the lighting taken down a notch or two it may have added a bit more mood to the picture.  As it is, the lighting is very even and well done but not very interesting.  I comment on the lighting because it is something I am constantly struggling/working on so I tend to notice it more in other pictures.  If you want to see evidence of my battle with lighting take a look at my peas entry :).', '2006-09-01 01:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781030, 387619, 60281, '<td valign="top">While this is a very good shot of an aeroplane it doesnt really say Top Gun the Movie to me. It lacks any drama. I understand that there is little you could do to add any as with this sort of subject you can only get what is available. As I said, it is a good picture, just not a drama picture.</td>', 'While this is a very good shot of an aeroplane it doesnt really say Top Gun the Movie to me. It lacks any drama. I understand that there is little you could do to add any as with this sort of subject you can only get what is available. As I said, it is a good picture, just not a drama picture.', '2006-09-01 01:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781049, 387019, 59564, '<td valign="top">very nice.  The soft focus is beautiful here. The lighting also makes it very moody.  I love it.</td>', 'very nice.  The soft focus is beautiful here. The lighting also makes it very moody.  I love it.', '2006-09-01 01:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781068, 385067, 59564, '<td valign="top">nice :)  Seems a tad bright but I''m sure just getting her to pose for you is a feat!</td>', 'nice :)  Seems a tad bright but I''m sure just getting her to pose for you is a feat!', '2006-09-01 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781075, 387244, 60281, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if you had shone a mini torch on the light-sabres you may have been able to make them glow a little! Also a light above Darth Vader (no idea if I spelt that correctly) would have enhanced the outline of his head and perhaps cast some dramatic shadows.</td>', 'Perhaps if you had shone a mini torch on the light-sabres you may have been able to make them glow a little! Also a light above Darth Vader (no idea if I spelt that correctly) would have enhanced the outline of his head and perhaps cast some dramatic shadows.', '2006-09-01 01:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781090, 387713, 59564, '<td valign="top">May be my monitor but it seems a little bright.  I really like the setup though.  May be the golden colors of the grass and the golden color of the deer that make it seem a little bright.</td>', 'May be my monitor but it seems a little bright.  I really like the setup though.  May be the golden colors of the grass and the golden color of the deer that make it seem a little bright.', '2006-09-01 01:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781098, 387058, 60281, '<td valign="top">This seems to be somewhat out of focus. Focusing close-up shots is very tricky. Sometimes it is best to take several images and pick the one with best focus. A little sharpening in a photo editor would have helped but is no substitute for getting good focus in the first place.</td>', 'This seems to be somewhat out of focus. Focusing close-up shots is very tricky. Sometimes it is best to take several images and pick the one with best focus. A little sharpening in a photo editor would have helped but is no substitute for getting good focus in the first place.', '2006-09-01 01:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781113, 385530, 59564, '<td valign="top">You''ve picked one of my favorite movies ever.  The person in the pictures kinda looks like adam sandler too :)  I really like the composition.  May have gotten a little better lighting on the persons face by having the side of his face towards the sun kind of how the ball is.  Either way great shot and extra points for a sandler movie.</td>', 'You''ve picked one of my favorite movies ever.  The person in the pictures kinda looks like adam sandler too :)  I really like the composition.  May have gotten a little better lighting on the persons face by having the side of his face towards the sun kind of how the ball is.  Either way great shot and extra points for a sandler movie.', '2006-09-01 01:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781117, 387766, 59564, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic.  Her face may be a bit dark but adorable.</td>', 'This is fantastic.  Her face may be a bit dark but adorable.', '2006-09-01 01:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781130, 385663, 60281, '<td valign="top">Maybe taking this image from a lower angle would have made the insects more menacing. I guess you would have to have them on the very edge of a table to get the camera any lower. Also the forward leg of the centre insect has been cropped off and it is those legs that are part of their menace.</td>', 'Maybe taking this image from a lower angle would have made the insects more menacing. I guess you would have to have them on the very edge of a table to get the camera any lower. Also the forward leg of the centre insect has been cropped off and it is those legs that are part of their menace.', '2006-09-01 01:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781136, 387847, 59564, '<td valign="top">I''ve found a lot of movies in this challenge that I am now going to have to go rent.  My eyes keep being drawn to the people on the deck but the plant covering the guy in the white shirts face is kind of distracting.  Not a lot that you could do since they probably wouldn''t take kindly to you tossing their plant in the water.  Overall though very nice.</td>', 'I''ve found a lot of movies in this challenge that I am now going to have to go rent.  My eyes keep being drawn to the people on the deck but the plant covering the guy in the white shirts face is kind of distracting.  Not a lot that you could do since they probably wouldn''t take kindly to you tossing their plant in the water.  Overall though very nice.', '2006-09-01 01:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781142, 386403, 59564, '<td valign="top">Wonderful catch and the tripods are the first thing that popped into my head when I saw this before I even saw the title.</td>', 'Wonderful catch and the tripods are the first thing that popped into my head when I saw this before I even saw the title.', '2006-09-01 01:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781146, 387847, 60281, '<td valign="top">This is quite a nice composition but the hanging basket in front of the mans face is rather distracting and spoils things somewhat.</td>', 'This is quite a nice composition but the hanging basket in front of the mans face is rather distracting and spoils things somewhat.', '2006-09-01 01:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
