(2781162, 385189, 59564, '<td valign="top">The angle of the light post is throwing me off a little.  I like the lines in the shot though (literally the power lines).</td>', 'The angle of the light post is throwing me off a little.  I like the lines in the shot though (literally the power lines).', '2006-09-01 01:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781182, 385425, 59564, '<td valign="top">Great, now dueling banjos is stuck in my head.  Thanks. :)  Great setup.  The focus seems a little soft but overall very good I think.</td>', 'Great, now dueling banjos is stuck in my head.  Thanks. :)  Great setup.  The focus seems a little soft but overall very good I think.', '2006-09-01 01:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781183, 387805, 53964, '<td valign="top">Photographer''s notes are hidden until after voting. IMO using the title to slip them in during voting seems a little ...... tacky? I do like the shot, though.</td>', 'Photographer''s notes are hidden until after voting. IMO using the title to slip them in during voting seems a little ...... tacky? I do like the shot, though.', '2006-09-01 01:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781203, 385415, 60281, '<td valign="top">An unusual crop, which I like and a nice choice of frame. Im not to keen on all the stuff in the far background on the left, I just find it distracting. I like the right-hand background however and the lighting works well.</td>', 'An unusual crop, which I like and a nice choice of frame. Im not to keen on all the stuff in the far background on the left, I just find it distracting. I like the right-hand background however and the lighting works well.', '2006-09-01 01:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781210, 387861, 59564, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Very freaky.  The lighting falling on some of the other things in the room such as the small reflection to the right of the door about mid way up the wall takes a little away I think.  It may have been quite a bit more moody and dramatic had the only visible objects in the photo been the ones on the floor directly in front of the lit room.</td>', 'Great shot.  Very freaky.  The lighting falling on some of the other things in the room such as the small reflection to the right of the door about mid way up the wall takes a little away I think.  It may have been quite a bit more moody and dramatic had the only visible objects in the photo been the ones on the floor directly in front of the lit room.', '2006-09-01 01:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781218, 385953, 59564, '<td valign="top">Man, if the focus on the face had been a little sharper this would have been dead on for me.  Wonderful idea and quite a bit of work put into the setup!  Overall I really enjoy this. 7</td>', 'Man, if the focus on the face had been a little sharper this would have been dead on for me.  Wonderful idea and quite a bit of work put into the setup!  Overall I really enjoy this. 7', '2006-09-01 01:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
