(2781234, 387976, 59564, '<td valign="top">Seems a little bit dark which loses some of the detail of the house.  overall good setup though.</td>', 'Seems a little bit dark which loses some of the detail of the house.  overall good setup though.', '2006-09-01 02:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781237, 387222, 60281, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this shot a lot if it werent for all the lens flare. In some ways the lens flare is interesting and adds to the drama but I think it is just too much. When shooting towards the sun you could try shielding some of the glair on the lens with your hand.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this shot a lot if it werent for all the lens flare. In some ways the lens flare is interesting and adds to the drama but I think it is just too much. When shooting towards the sun you could try shielding some of the glair on the lens with your hand.', '2006-09-01 02:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781241, 386308, 59564, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lighting.  I''m guessing from the painted wall behind him that it''s in an exhibit somewhere.</td>', 'Great colors and lighting.  I''m guessing from the painted wall behind him that it''s in an exhibit somewhere.', '2006-09-01 02:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781248, 386863, 59564, '<td valign="top">If the person walking had been a little more in focus I think it would have added to the shot.</td>', 'If the person walking had been a little more in focus I think it would have added to the shot.', '2006-09-01 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781250, 387539, 60281, '<td valign="top">The image seems very soft for some reason and I cant make my mind up why. It looks like it may be camera shake or perhaps the leaf moved a little during the exposure. If so a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped.</td>', 'The image seems very soft for some reason and I cant make my mind up why. It looks like it may be camera shake or perhaps the leaf moved a little during the exposure. If so a slightly faster shutter speed would have helped.', '2006-09-01 02:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
