(2786235, 386529, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this.  Also, I think the red, green and blue sets up a pleasantly colored picture.  However, the colors are falling a bit short to me.  Maybe a every so slight shift in saturation, especially on the red, would help a bit--just to give it an extra punch.  Also, the white on the bridge railing looks a touch overexposed, adn this detracts from the overall effect as well.</td>', 'I like the composition on this.  Also, I think the red, green and blue sets up a pleasantly colored picture.  However, the colors are falling a bit short to me.  Maybe a every so slight shift in saturation, especially on the red, would help a bit--just to give it an extra punch.  Also, the white on the bridge railing looks a touch overexposed, adn this detracts from the overall effect as well.', '2006-09-02 00:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
