(2788880, 387739, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the centered composition with him standing away from the troops and in the spotlight. But then again I imagine how it would look if he was more to the left of the frame with his profile contrasted against the troops. The picture has the correct exposue and perfect dof.<br/>I find myself looking at the garbage on the ground and the one guy''s belly sticking out of his jacket and the manicured lawn. These things tend to take away from the fantasy of the picture. I know they could not be controled by the photographer.</td>', 'I like the centered composition with him standing away from the troops and in the spotlight. But then again I imagine how it would look if he was more to the left of the frame with his profile contrasted against the troops. The picture has the correct exposue and perfect dof.I find myself looking at the garbage on the ground and the one guy''s belly sticking out of his jacket and the manicured lawn. These things tend to take away from the fantasy of the picture. I know they could not be controled by the photographer.', '2006-09-02 16:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
