(2789911, 385906, 11800, '<td valign="top">Been to long since I saw that movie to know if this is an actual scene. The dof and texture of the towel along with it''s lightness really makes an in-your-face statement that would be true to the movie. Who''d''thought a towel could be so dangerous looking. The only negative is his hand behind his back. It throws off the balance.</td>', 'Been to long since I saw that movie to know if this is an actual scene. The dof and texture of the towel along with it''s lightness really makes an in-your-face statement that would be true to the movie. Who''d''thought a towel could be so dangerous looking. The only negative is his hand behind his back. It throws off the balance.', '2006-09-02 20:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
