(2790157, 386913, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very nice representation from one of my favorite movies, though the title is just <i>The Gold Rush</i>. If I could have photographed it this well, my favorite bit was when they ate the shoe -- Charlie wrapping the shoelaces around his fork like spaghetti ... that shoe was actually fabricated out of licorice.<br/> <br/>My mom knew Charlie Chaplin : )</td>', 'Very nice representation from one of my favorite movies, though the title is just The Gold Rush. If I could have photographed it this well, my favorite bit was when they ate the shoe -- Charlie wrapping the shoelaces around his fork like spaghetti ... that shoe was actually fabricated out of licorice. My mom knew Charlie Chaplin : )', '2006-09-02 21:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
