(2790218, 387485, 62187, '<td valign="top">Oh...that was one of my favorite movies way back when! I think more of the helicopter would have been better but it''s probably a modern helicopter so your edit is good. Looks like you got some dust on the lense or debris in the air?</td>', 'Oh...that was one of my favorite movies way back when! I think more of the helicopter would have been better but it''s probably a modern helicopter so your edit is good. Looks like you got some dust on the lense or debris in the air?', '2006-09-02 22:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
