(2790278, 387971, 62187, '<td valign="top">My sister, for years, insisted I watch that movie. I did...I didn''t like it and maybe I missed something. The music was good. I didn''t understand the movie and I don''t understand why you cropped out the end of the handgun. So...I''ll say nice photo, pass on voting and leave it to better movie buffs then myself. Good luck...</td>', 'My sister, for years, insisted I watch that movie. I did...I didn''t like it and maybe I missed something. The music was good. I didn''t understand the movie and I don''t understand why you cropped out the end of the handgun. So...I''ll say nice photo, pass on voting and leave it to better movie buffs then myself. Good luck...', '2006-09-02 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790279, 387054, 43115, '<td valign="top">I get that this is a movie scene being filmed, but the challenge seems to call for a reproduction of a movie scene that was already done.  Also the photo is so overcompressed or low resolution to begin with that the whole thing looks blocky and fuzzy.  Sorry. :(</td>', 'I get that this is a movie scene being filmed, but the challenge seems to call for a reproduction of a movie scene that was already done.  Also the photo is so overcompressed or low resolution to begin with that the whole thing looks blocky and fuzzy.  Sorry. :(', '2006-09-02 22:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790292, 385425, 62187, '<td valign="top">I don''t hear any banjo music yet so I''m leaving while the gettin'' is good. Here''s a 10 and I''ll be on my way. Diddle dee dum dee dum dee do do...see, there is it...see ya!</td>', 'I don''t hear any banjo music yet so I''m leaving while the gettin'' is good. Here''s a 10 and I''ll be on my way. Diddle dee dum dee dum dee do do...see, there is it...see ya!', '2006-09-02 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790293, 387378, 43115, '<td valign="top">Great setup and execution.  The exposure looks off a bit though, too much highlights and shadows, not enough midtones.  I imagine it was a tough shot to get right technically, perhaps some practice with Photoshop would get you there.  Above average, but the technicals keep it from being a 10.</td>', 'Great setup and execution.  The exposure looks off a bit though, too much highlights and shadows, not enough midtones.  I imagine it was a tough shot to get right technically, perhaps some practice with Photoshop would get you there.  Above average, but the technicals keep it from being a 10.', '2006-09-02 22:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2790295, 387125, 59564, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea.  It may have enhanced a little bit if the expression on her face was more fear than laughter but then again I can''t remember the movie too well so she may well have been laughing.  In any case good photo, a little sharper focus on her face may have improved too in my opinion.</td>', 'Very cool idea.  It may have enhanced a little bit if the expression on her face was more fear than laughter but then again I can''t remember the movie too well so she may well have been laughing.  In any case good photo, a little sharper focus on her face may have improved too in my opinion.', '2006-09-02 22:38:04.000000', NULL, 1);
