(2790430, 385957, 59564, '<td valign="top">great!  I know these horses are traveling at light speed but a little sharper focus on them may have added to this.</td>', 'great!  I know these horses are traveling at light speed but a little sharper focus on them may have added to this.', '2006-09-02 23:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
