(2793071, 386670, 43565, '<td valign="top">Never saw The Godfather: Part II, so I will assume it had a boat scene somewhat like this.  I like the high-key effect on the water and the placement of the boat.  8</td>', 'Never saw The Godfather: Part II, so I will assume it had a boat scene somewhat like this.  I like the high-key effect on the water and the placement of the boat.  8', '2006-09-03 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793116, 386913, 18073, '<td valign="top">Easily the best image in the challenge.  I love everything about this image, the light, the expression and most important of all, how faithful the image seems to the original.  Top marks, this has ribbon all over it in my opinion!</td>', 'Easily the best image in the challenge.  I love everything about this image, the light, the expression and most important of all, how faithful the image seems to the original.  Top marks, this has ribbon all over it in my opinion!', '2006-09-03 20:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793130, 387603, 11800, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see the movie so I didn''t score you on that part. Picture wise, the dof throws me off. The blurry forground isn''t attractive. Maybe if the dof were reversed it would give more dimension to the shot. I like the colors and high contrast processing but the grainyness detracts because it looks like a small crop was done from a larger picture. Not saying it was, just what it looks like to me.</td>', 'I didn''t see the movie so I didn''t score you on that part. Picture wise, the dof throws me off. The blurry forground isn''t attractive. Maybe if the dof were reversed it would give more dimension to the shot. I like the colors and high contrast processing but the grainyness detracts because it looks like a small crop was done from a larger picture. Not saying it was, just what it looks like to me.', '2006-09-03 20:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793150, 387976, 11800, '<td valign="top">I didn''t see this movie so I''m not voting on that part of the challenge. The picture is dark which is ok to set the mood for monsters but the blue sky contrasts too much to make the house look scary. Instead I find I am just looking at a house that looks like any house in my neighborhood.</td>', 'I didn''t see this movie so I''m not voting on that part of the challenge. The picture is dark which is ok to set the mood for monsters but the blue sky contrasts too much to make the house look scary. Instead I find I am just looking at a house that looks like any house in my neighborhood.', '2006-09-03 20:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793197, 386863, 11800, '<td valign="top">The centered composition makes the picture static. It might have had some drama if it was composed so that only the koisk and person was in the frame. The other people do not add anything to the story. If the person was running and the other people were looking at him in shock, then they would add to the story.</td>', 'The centered composition makes the picture static. It might have had some drama if it was composed so that only the koisk and person was in the frame. The other people do not add anything to the story. If the person was running and the other people were looking at him in shock, then they would add to the story.', '2006-09-03 21:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793198, 387907, 54770, '<td valign="top">WHAT A SHOT WAY TO GO...LOOKS TOO REAL KIND OF CREEPY AND THE LOOK ON HIS FACE WOW...GREAT GREAT SHOT...ADDING TO MY FAV. GOOD LUCK</td>', 'WHAT A SHOT WAY TO GO...LOOKS TOO REAL KIND OF CREEPY AND THE LOOK ON HIS FACE WOW...GREAT GREAT SHOT...ADDING TO MY FAV. GOOD LUCK', '2006-09-03 21:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793206, 387378, 54770, '<td valign="top">HE EVEN LOOKS LIKE TOM FROM THIS POSITION...GREAT GREAT SHOT LOVED IT ADDING TO MY FAV. GOOD LUCK</td>', 'HE EVEN LOOKS LIKE TOM FROM THIS POSITION...GREAT GREAT SHOT LOVED IT ADDING TO MY FAV. GOOD LUCK', '2006-09-03 21:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793253, 385067, 11800, '<td valign="top">didn''t see the movie, not scoring on that. The full frontal on-camera flash is not your friend. Look at his poor eyes. Look at the huge shadow behind him. These are things we try to avoid by not using the on-camera flash. No good ever comes from relying on that as your single light source. <br/>If you have time, go read Cindy''s thread on studio lighting. <br/>He''s a cute pup.</td>', 'didn''t see the movie, not scoring on that. The full frontal on-camera flash is not your friend. Look at his poor eyes. Look at the huge shadow behind him. These are things we try to avoid by not using the on-camera flash. No good ever comes from relying on that as your single light source. If you have time, go read Cindy''s thread on studio lighting. He''s a cute pup.', '2006-09-03 21:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793271, 387420, 11800, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t to bad. I think the composition could be a lot better. And the set could have been prepared with more thought as to what is in the frame and what isn''t.</td>', 'The lighting isn''t to bad. I think the composition could be a lot better. And the set could have been prepared with more thought as to what is in the frame and what isn''t.', '2006-09-03 21:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793294, 385189, 11800, '<td valign="top">didn''t see the movie, not scoring on that. Yes it is a light but is it interesting? You might want to think about the next questions. <br/>Is there a reason I would want to look at this instead of looking out my own door and seeing a real light? <br/>What can you do to make it so it''s not something I see many times everyday?<br/>How can you make it new to me?<br/></td>', 'didn''t see the movie, not scoring on that. Yes it is a light but is it interesting? You might want to think about the next questions. Is there a reason I would want to look at this instead of looking out my own door and seeing a real light? What can you do to make it so it''s not something I see many times everyday?How can you make it new to me?', '2006-09-03 21:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793302, 385138, 11800, '<td valign="top">it is small. sorry for all the comments you are getting on it. I know I''d be really bummed if something like this happened to me.</td>', 'it is small. sorry for all the comments you are getting on it. I know I''d be really bummed if something like this happened to me.', '2006-09-03 21:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2793335, 388032, 11800, '<td valign="top">It looks underexposed which increased the random color noise. The set needs to be groomed more. It looks cluttered which is ok as a work area but not ok as a location for a pretty picture.</td>', 'It looks underexposed which increased the random color noise. The set needs to be groomed more. It looks cluttered which is ok as a work area but not ok as a location for a pretty picture.', '2006-09-03 21:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
