(2793696, 386998, 50695, '<td valign="top">the closest thing I could find was "Boatman of the River Padma", but that seemed to use natural lighting a la the 70s. In fact, I''ve never seen a movie that uses the Infrared filter...</td>', 'the closest thing I could find was "Boatman of the River Padma", but that seemed to use natural lighting a la the 70s. In fact, I''ve never seen a movie that uses the Infrared filter...', '2006-09-03 23:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
