(2805471, 387907, 39057, '<td valign="top">5d, 4D 1D...2 megapixel k-mart camera....I don''t think it would have mattered what you used for this shot. Lighting, set-up and post processing was the key.<br/> <br/>How you get the color/dodge/burn effect on the jeans, rag and dirt on shirt and feet in basic editing is beyond my knowledge of editing in Photoshop.<br/> <br/>Good Job.</td>', '5d, 4D 1D...2 megapixel k-mart camera....I don''t think it would have mattered what you used for this shot. Lighting, set-up and post processing was the key. How you get the color/dodge/burn effect on the jeans, rag and dirt on shirt and feet in basic editing is beyond my knowledge of editing in Photoshop. Good Job.', '2006-09-06 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
