(2807894, 385953, 53316, '<td valign="top">Back for another comment.. :-) Although the resemblance to Johnny Depp isn''t there, that matters not one bit! Because the makeup is so key to that scene, and you have the makeup done so well.  In fact, when I first glanced at this image I thought his eyes were open! That was exactly what I thought while watching the movie - and as it is what they wanted us to think, I really feel you have perfectly captured the key emotional element in the scene.  Great job.</td>', 'Back for another comment.. :-) Although the resemblance to Johnny Depp isn''t there, that matters not one bit! Because the makeup is so key to that scene, and you have the makeup done so well.  In fact, when I first glanced at this image I thought his eyes were open! That was exactly what I thought while watching the movie - and as it is what they wanted us to think, I really feel you have perfectly captured the key emotional element in the scene.  Great job.', '2006-09-06 23:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
