(2820203, 387625, 60505, '<td valign="top">Got the shock value atmosphere of this movie perfectly. This is one of the most disturbing (memorable)scenes in cinema, but I seem to remember it was a straight (cut throat) razor was used, not curved as you shot. 10 out of 10 for bravery to try this yourself. This photo did not receive the credit it deserves in this competition IMHO. Excellent reconstruction!</td>', 'Got the shock value atmosphere of this movie perfectly. This is one of the most disturbing (memorable)scenes in cinema, but I seem to remember it was a straight (cut throat) razor was used, not curved as you shot. 10 out of 10 for bravery to try this yourself. This photo did not receive the credit it deserves in this competition IMHO. Excellent reconstruction!', '2006-09-10 13:48:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2820217, 387193, 60505, '<td valign="top">Great Photo. Cant believe so few saw this movie! First scene set in England with child (in bright red)playing in the garden,(photo is reminiscent of this) then drowning in the pond. The rest of this beautiful movie is in Venice with recurent glimpses of the child in red appearing and disappearing. Great movie. Should have scored higher in my opinion.</td>', 'Great Photo. Cant believe so few saw this movie! First scene set in England with child (in bright red)playing in the garden,(photo is reminiscent of this) then drowning in the pond. The rest of this beautiful movie is in Venice with recurent glimpses of the child in red appearing and disappearing. Great movie. Should have scored higher in my opinion.', '2006-09-10 13:54:10.000000', NULL, 0),
