(2864047, 386913, 48890, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and tones.  The plate should not be black? and there should be plates and glasses to the left and right.  From what I remember of the original scene, it was very tight at the table.  He was acting this scene very compactly, with both elbows tucked in; the model (you?) is too comfortable in this picture.  Perhaps I don''t remember the original well. :)  But what a great choice for the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice lighting and tones.  The plate should not be black? and there should be plates and glasses to the left and right.  From what I remember of the original scene, it was very tight at the table.  He was acting this scene very compactly, with both elbows tucked in; the model (you?) is too comfortable in this picture.  Perhaps I don''t remember the original well. :)  But what a great choice for the challenge!', '2006-09-25 18:35:57.000000', NULL, 0),
